    "text": "COMMS ANNEX — DUTY SHEET — 16 OCT 1998\n\n18:00  Haddad on. Uplink nominal.\n21:15  Uplink drifting. Haddad realigned the north array. Nominal.\n23:50  Dr. Voss left a tape on the annex machine. Label reads:\n       FOR DANIEL — DO NOT ERASE.\n       Nobody on site called Daniel. Left it where it was. She was very clear.\n01:30  Annex radio opened squelch by itself four times. Logged.\n02:38  Haddad says the monitor is printing tomorrow's date. Then a date that isn't tomorrow.\n02:41  Going down to find Hale.",
    "title": "Annex duty sheet"
